<title>USA: Etec Systems on S&amp;P SmallCap 600 index.</title>
<headline>Etec Systems on S&amp;P SmallCap 600 index.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Wednesday that Etec Systems Inc will replace Sunshine Mining and Refining Co on the S&amp;P SmallCap 600 index.</p>
<p>The change went into effect after the close of trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>Sunshine Mining was removed from the index because its stock has consistently closed below $1.00 per share, S&amp;P said.</p>
<p>((--Wall St Desk, 212-859-1721))</p>
